          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azimaveti mwene Adiyeli ni we wari umutware w'ububiko bw'umwami, Yehonatani mwene Uziya ni we wari umutware w'ububiko bwo mu mirima, no mu midugudu no mu birorero no mu bihome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eziri mwene Kelubu ni we watwaraga abahinzi bo mu misozi bahingaga ubutaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimeyi w'i Rama ni we wari umutware w'inzabibu, na Zabudi w'i Shifimu ni we wari umutware w'imbuto z'inzabibu zo gushyira mu bubiko bwa vino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
